`s 2018(j)(4) the guidance affects the requirement` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the requirement is a requirement under section 7517 of this title, including the eligibility of a retail food store to participate in a project funded under such section`
            THEN JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Guidance provided under this subsection shall not affect any requirements under section 7517 of this title"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the bar is on any "requirements under section 7517"

-- src:1418 | The Secretary shall submit to the Committee on Agriculture of the House of Representatives and the Committee on Agriculture, Nutrition, and Forestry of the Senate an annual report describing the types of incentives approved under this subsection.
