        IF `a year has passed since the last report`
            THEN JUST TRUE  -- the text says yes: "an annual report describing the types of incentives approved under this subsection"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (silent): "annual" is the only timing the text gives, and it names no date
